# graphify — keep the current graph (graphify-out/graph.json, GRAPH_REPORT.md,
# manifest.json, graph.html, .graphify_*) tracked as the live deliverable; its
# dated backup snapshots and AST/semantic cache are local-only and unbounded
# (a new ~2-5MB folder every day the tool runs) — never commit them.
graphify-out/cache/
graphify-out/[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]/
